<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Defs>

	<!--
		Cold torpor for the reptile mamonos (built 2026-09-30), the hediff
		PMM_Reptiles.HediffGiver_ColdTorpor builds while she is below her safe temperature and
		fades once she is back inside it. The giver's own comment carries the whole reasoning;
		what matters here is the shape.

		Stages, as the cold deepens: shivering (hidden), sluggish, drowsy, torpid. Only two of
		the four do anything drastic - drowsy costs her a third of her consciousness and torpid
		caps it at a tenth, which lays her down where she stands, the same end VRE's hypothermic
		hibernation reaches. Nothing here is lethal, and no stage touches Breathing or Blood
		Pumping: this is a slow body, not a wounded one.

		hungerRateFactorOffset is the hibernation half. A torpid reptile burns a tenth of the
		food she normally would, so a winter slept away does not also starve her, and a drowsy
		one eats noticeably less. Vanilla's own HypothermicSlowdown makes the same move at a
		smaller scale (-0.1, -0.4), which is where the shape came from.

		restFallFactor is what gets her to sleep at all: it makes her tire faster, so a torpid
		mamono lies down on her own rather than being held down by the capacity cap alone.
	-->
	<HediffDef>
		<defName>PMM_Hediff_ColdTorpor</defName>
		<label>cold torpor</label>
		<description>Her cold-blooded body has gone slow and stupid with the cold. She will keep working, sluggishly, until the cold deepens enough to put her to sleep - and she will not wake from that sleep until she is warm again.</description>
		<hediffClass>HediffWithComps</hediffClass>
		<defaultLabelColor>(0.62, 0.78, 0.9)</defaultLabelColor>
		<stages>
			<li>
				<label>shivering</label>
				<becomeVisible>false</becomeVisible>
			</li>
			<li>
				<label>sluggish</label>
				<minSeverity>0.05</minSeverity>
				<restFallFactor>1.3</restFallFactor>
				<capMods>
					<li>
						<capacity>Moving</capacity>
						<offset>-0.15</offset>
					</li>
					<li>
						<capacity>Manipulation</capacity>
						<offset>-0.15</offset>
					</li>
				</capMods>
			</li>
			<li>
				<label>drowsy</label>
				<minSeverity>0.3</minSeverity>
				<restFallFactor>1.8</restFallFactor>
				<hungerRateFactorOffset>-0.4</hungerRateFactorOffset>
				<capMods>
					<li>
						<capacity>Moving</capacity>
						<offset>-0.35</offset>
					</li>
					<li>
						<capacity>Manipulation</capacity>
						<offset>-0.35</offset>
					</li>
					<li>
						<capacity>Consciousness</capacity>
						<offset>-0.35</offset>
					</li>
				</capMods>
			</li>
			<li>
				<label>torpid</label>
				<minSeverity>0.7</minSeverity>
				<restFallFactor>2</restFallFactor>
				<hungerRateFactorOffset>-0.9</hungerRateFactorOffset>
				<capMods>
					<li>
						<capacity>Consciousness</capacity>
						<setMax>0.1</setMax>
					</li>
				</capMods>
			</li>
		</stages>
	</HediffDef>

</Defs>
